"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">prev</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pendingRef.current);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        pendingRef.current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        rafRef.current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }, []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { text, appendToken };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>requestAnimationFrame</code> 把多个 token 合并到下一帧统一更新，把更新频率从&quot;token 速率&quot;降到&quot;显示器刷新率（60fps）&quot;，既不影响视觉流畅度，又显著减少渲染次数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"请求中断与-abortcontroller\">请求中断与 AbortController</h2><p>用户可能在生成过程中点击&quot;停止&quot;按钮，或者页面卸载时需要取消进行中的请求。<code>AbortController</code> 是处理这类场景的标准方式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function useChatStream() {&#10;  const abortRef = useRef&lt;AbortController | null&gt;(null);&#10;&#10;  const sendMessage = async (content: string) =&gt; {&#10;    // 取消上一个进行中的请求&#10;    abortRef.current?.abort();&#10;    abortRef.current = new AbortController();&#10;&#10;    try {&#10;      await streamLLMResponse(messages, abortRef.current.signal);&#10;    } catch (error) {&#10;      if (error instanceof Error &amp;&amp; error.name === &#39;AbortError&#39;) {&#10;        // 用户主动取消，不视为错误&#10;        console.log(&#39;请求已取消&#39;);&#10;      } else {&#10;        throw error;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  const stopGeneration = () =&gt; {&#10;    abortRef.current?.abort();&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  // 组件卸载时取消进行中的请求&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    return () =&gt; {&#10;      abortRef.current?.abort();&#10;    };&#10;  }, []);&#10;&#10;  return { sendMessage, stopGeneration };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useChatStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> abortRef</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">AbortController</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sendMessage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">content</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 取消上一个进行中的请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    abortRef.current?.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">abort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    abortRef.current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AbortController</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> streamLLMResponse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(messages, abortRef.current.signal);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (error) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (error </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">instanceof</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> error.name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'AbortError'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 用户主动取消，不视为错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'请求已取消'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        throw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> error;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> stopGeneration</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    abortRef.current?.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">abort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 组件卸载时取消进行中的请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  useEffect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      abortRef.current?.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">abort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }, []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { sendMessage, stopGeneration };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>服务端也需要监听 <code>req.signal</code>（在 Next.js Route Handler 中）或等价机制，在客户端中断连接时停止调用 LLM API，避免浪费模型调用费用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"错误处理-ai-特有的错误场景\">错误处理：AI 特有的错误场景</h2><p>LLM API 的错误模式与普通 REST API 不同，需要针对性处理：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误类型</th>\n<th>HTTP 状态码</th>\n<th>触发原因</th>\n<th>处理策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Rate Limit</td>\n<td>429</td>\n<td>超出每分钟请求限额</td>\n<td>指数退避重试，显示队列等待状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型超时</td>\n<td>504</td>\n<td>生成时间过长</td>\n<td>自动重试一次，提示用户缩短 Prompt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内容过滤</td>\n<td>400</td>\n<td>Prompt 或响应违反内容策略</td>\n<td>提示用户修改输入，不自动重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务过载</td>\n<td>503</td>\n<td>模型提供商服务繁忙</td>\n<td>指数退避重试，显示&quot;服务繁忙&quot;状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流中断</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>连接在流式传输中途断开</td>\n<td>检测未完成标记，提示用户重新生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Token 超限</td>\n<td>400</td>\n<td>消息历史超过上下文窗口</td>\n<td>截断历史，保留系统提示和最近几轮</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>流中断是 SSE 特有的棘手场景——连接可能在生成到一半时断开，客户端已经显示了部分内容。最好的做法是记录已收到的内容，在 UI 上显示&quot;生成被中断&quot;状态，并提供&quot;重新生成&quot;按钮。</p>\n<p>对于需要在流式过程中检测错误的场景，注意 SSE 流中也可以传递错误事件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 服务端发送错误事件&#10;// event: error&#10;// data: {&quot;code&quot;: &quot;rate_limit&quot;, &quot;message&quot;: &quot;Too many requests&quot;}&#10;&#10;// 客户端监听&#10;source.addEventListener(&#39;error&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  const errorData = JSON.parse((event as MessageEvent).data);&#10;  showError(errorData.message);&#10;  source.close();&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 服务端发送错误事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// event: error</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// data: {\"code\": \"rate_limit\", \"message\": \"Too many requests\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 客户端监听</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">source.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> errorData</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((event </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MessageEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  showError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(errorData.message);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"与-vercel-ai-sdk-的关系\">与 Vercel AI SDK 的关系</h2><p>以上是手动实现流式接入的底层细节。在实际项目中，Vercel AI SDK（<code>ai</code> 包）的 <code>useChat</code> Hook 封装了上述全部逻辑：SSE 解析、AbortController 管理、消息状态、错误处理。</p>\n<p>了解底层机制的价值在于：当 SDK 行为不符合预期时能够调试，以及在不使用 SDK 的场景（如非 React 技术栈、自定义流式格式）中能够自己实现。关于 SDK 的完整选型分析，参见同章节的 <a href=\"ai-sdk-landscape\">AI SDK 生态与选型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>LLM 流式接入的工程重点集中在三个层面：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>传输层</strong>：SSE 是绝大多数 LLM 场景的正确选择，只有协作/双向 Agent 场景才需要 WebSocket</li>\n<li><strong>数据解析层</strong>：buffer 管理是手动实现流式解析的核心，确保跨 chunk 的行能正确拼接</li>\n<li><strong>UI 层</strong>：<code>requestAnimationFrame</code> 批量合并 token 更新，<code>AbortController</code> 处理中断，错误状态需要针对 AI 特有场景（Rate Limit、流中断、Token 超限）分类处理</li>\n</ul>\n<p>掌握这些底层机制后，无论是使用 SDK 的快速方案还是自定义实现，都能在遇到问题时快速定位根因。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LLM API 流式接入模式","id":"llm-api-流式接入模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"SSE 与 WebSocket：协议选择的决策逻辑","id":"sse-与-websocket-协议选择的决策逻辑"},{"level":2,"text":"两种实现方式：EventSource vs Fetch Stream","id":"两种实现方式-eventsource-vs-fetch-stream"},{"level":3,"text":"EventSource API（GET 请求场景）","id":"eventsource-api-get-请求场景"},{"level":3,"text":"Fetch + ReadableStream（POST 请求场景）","id":"fetch-readablestream-post-请求场景"},{"level":2,"text":"背压处理与渲染节流","id":"背压处理与渲染节流"},{"level":2,"text":"请求中断与 AbortController","id":"请求中断与-abortcontroller"},{"level":2,"text":"错误处理：AI 特有的错误场景","id":"错误处理-ai-特有的错误场景"},{"level":2,"text":"与 Vercel AI SDK 的关系","id":"与-vercel-ai-sdk-的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"浏览器端推理与 WebLLM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-ai-integration/foundations/on-device-inference"}}